id":"d-raw-title","type":"Text"},{"config":{"direction":"vertical","gap":0},"id":"d-raw-wrap","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"code":"{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"label\": \"Pay now\",\n    \"variant\": \"primary\"\n  },\n  \"variantState\": {\n    \"disabled\": true,\n    \"variant\": \"secondary\"\n  }\n}","label":{"$i18n":"inspect.detail.raw"},"maxHeight":224},"id":"d-raw","type":"CodeBlock"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"vertical","gap":0,"visible":false},"id":"d-raw-base-wrap","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"code":"{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"label\": \"Pay now\",\n    \"variant\": \"primary\"\n  }\n}","label":{"$i18n":"inspect.detail.raw"},"maxHeight":224},"id":"d-raw-base","type":"CodeBlock"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Disclosure"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Inspector","spec":{"accessibility":["Every status is an icon with an accessible name and a word, never color alone; the thread rows name their status, author and excerpt.","The raw state is a labelled, keyboard-scrollable region; copy buttons name what they copy.","Identities are mono and never translated."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Icon, Badge, Button, Table, TableRow, ListItem, Avatar, Disclosure, CodeBlock, Alert, EmptyState, SegmentedControl, Segment); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The Slot path ancestors are Text, not buttons that select the ancestor; the size is one sentence, not mono values; the Base column reads \"Widget default\" in every row, as the app does.","The age of a comment is a baked sample (panel.sample.*), as are the comment excerpts and authors; the Widget, its ids, the revisions and the sizes are sample content.","The Inspector shows no Properties, State or Events tables of the Widget: the app has none (Variant overrides and raw state only).","Tooltips, the copy toast, the keyboard shortcut (Cmd+C copies the id) and the scroll position of the panel are not modelled.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (Widget ids, codes, revisions); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member selected the Inspect tab of the right panel of a View in the Workbench and a Widget in the View, the Widget tree or the canvas; the panel is 340px wide at the right edge and scrolls.","The base state is the Button #checkout-submit of the View Checkout with the Variant card-declined selected, for a member who may comment on a desktop layout: its label “Pay now”, two Variant overrides, one finding and three comments.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; below 640px Comment is not offered, a phone reads, replies and resolves but never creates a canvas comment."],"intent":"Show the Inspect tab of a View's right panel as built from Adapter Widgets only: what the selected Widget is (type, label), where it sits (identity, Slot path, size), how the selected Variant changes it (a property table against the Widget default), what is wrong with it, what has been said about it, and identities and raw state behind Details.","interactionRules":["The header names the Widget type and its label as authored (a translated label shows its text for the selected Locale, an untranslated key shows the key in mono, no label shows nothing); Comment opens the composer at the Widget, and the copy button copies #id.","A Widget that is not rendered or not visible in the current Variant stays selected and says \"Not visible in this state\"; when its region cannot be measured the Inspector says precise highlighting is unavailable, and an offscreen or unmeasured size says so in place of the size.","In this Variant lists only the State the Variant overrides on this Widget, each Property against its Widget default; a Variant that cannot run shows its faults by code, and a Variant that is not defined in the View says so.","Findings lists the Checks findings that resolve to this Widget with the code and the sentence for it, each opening Checks; comments lists the Widget's threads with status, author, excerpt and age, six at most, then Show all in Comments.","Details holds the type, Widget id, depth, Variant, View id, View revision and geometry revision with a copy button for each identity, and the raw config and Variant state of the Widget; a selection that names a Widget the View no longer has shows a persistent notice with Clear selection, and nothing selected asks for a Widget.","A member without the key to comment is not offered Comment; the server stays the authority."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"b1c7e302-4a1d-4c2e-9f31-7a4c0d2e6b02"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"b1c7e303-4a1d-4c2e-9f31-7a4c0d2e6b03"},{"relation":"readiness","type":"view","viewId":"e9f5d101-3a1b-4c2d-9e4f-6b7c8d9eaf01"}],"requirements":["01a116f0-89b6-7d08-a850-e1ee1aecd51f"]},"variants":{"base-state":{"state":{"d-raw-base-wrap":{"visible":true},"d-raw-wrap":{"visible":false},"d-variant-base":{"visible":true},"d-variant-name":{"visible":false},"in-variant":{"visible":false}}},"comments-more":{"state":{"comments-all-wrap":{"visible":true},"comments-count":{"visible":false},"comments-count-many":{"visible":true},"thread-al":{"visible":true},"thread-bt":{"visible":true},"thread-dk":{"visible":true},"thread-js":{"visible":true},"thread-ml":{"visible":true},"thread-mq":{"visible":true},"thread-zz":{"visible":false}}},"comments-none":{"state":{"comments-count":{"visible":false},"comments-list":{"visible":false},"no-comments":{"visible":true